<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl" data-bs-theme="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>پنل مدیریت | نان و نان</title>

    <script>
      (function () {
        try {
          var t = localStorage.getItem('bubbleteale-theme');
          if (!t) t = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light';
          document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-bs-theme', t);
        } catch (e) {}
      })();
    </script>

    <link href="/css/bootstrap.rtl.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/icons-1.13.1/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

    <style>

        :root, [data-bs-theme="light"] {
            --bg-grad-1: var(--cream);
            --bg-grad-2: var(--cream-deep);
            --bg-grad-3: var(--surface-raised);
            --glass-bg: var(--surface-glass);
            --glass-border: var(--border-warm);
            --glass-shadow: rgba(var(--ink-rgb), .08);
            --glass-hover: var(--brand-soft);
            --text-main: var(--ink);
            --text-muted: var(--ink-muted);
            --input-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            --input-focus: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            --btn-bg: var(--surface-raised);
            --btn-hover: var(--brand-soft);
            --accent-color: var(--brand);
            --accent-light: var(--brand-light);
            --accent-hover: var(--brand-dark);
            --danger-color: #C1443A;
            --danger-hover: #A83A31;
            --success-color: #3E8A5B;
            --option-bg: var(--surface);
            --sidebar-width: 280px;
            --topbar-height: 72px;
        }

        [data-bs-theme="dark"] {
            --bg-grad-1: var(--cream);
            --bg-grad-2: var(--cream-deep);
            --bg-grad-3: var(--surface-raised);
            --glass-bg: var(--surface-glass);
            --glass-border: var(--border-warm);
            --glass-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
            --glass-hover: var(--brand-soft);
            --text-main: var(--ink);
            --text-muted: var(--ink-muted);
            --input-bg: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
            --input-focus: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            --btn-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            --btn-hover: var(--brand-soft);
            --accent-color: var(--brand);
            --accent-light: var(--brand-light);
            --accent-hover: var(--brand-dark);
            --danger-color: #E8716A;
            --danger-hover: #F08983;
            --success-color: #6FC090;
            --option-bg: var(--surface);
        }

        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        * { font-family: 'Vazirmatn', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; }

        body {
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background: linear-gradient(-45deg, var(--bg-grad-1), var(--bg-grad-2), var(--bg-grad-3));
            background-size: 400% 400%;
            animation: gradientBG 18s ease infinite;
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            transition: background-color 0.4s ease, color 0.4s ease;
        }

        @keyframes gradientBG {
            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        }

        body::before, body::after {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            will-change: transform;
        }
        body::before {
            width: 360px; height: 360px; top: -100px; left: -100px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%, rgba(var(--brand-rgb), .20), rgba(var(--brand-rgb), 0) 70%);
            animation: bubble-float-a 22s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        body::after {
            width: 280px; height: 280px; bottom: -70px; right: -70px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%, rgba(var(--steel-rgb), .18), rgba(var(--steel-rgb), 0) 70%);
            animation: bubble-float-b 26s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes bubble-float-a { 0%,100% { transform: translate3d(0,0,0) scale(1); } 50% { transform: translate3d(34px,44px,0) scale(1.08); } }
        @keyframes bubble-float-b { 0%,100% { transform: translate3d(0,0,0) scale(1); } 50% { transform: translate3d(-26px,-32px,0) scale(1.06); } }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { body::before, body::after { animation: none; } }

        :root { --ease-bubble: cubic-bezier(.34, 1.56, .64, 1); }
        .admin-layout { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

        .admin-layout { display: flex; min-height: 100vh; }

        .glass-panel {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(160%);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(160%);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px var(--glass-shadow);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .sidebar {
            width: var(--sidebar-width);
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; right: 0;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            z-index: 1050;
            border-left: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
            box-shadow: 4px 0 32px var(--glass-shadow);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
        .sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--glass-border); border-radius: 5px; }

        .sidebar-brand {
            height: var(--topbar-height);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .sidebar-brand .brand-mark {
            width: 42px; height: 42px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light), var(--accent-color));
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(87,45,119,0.35);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .sidebar-brand .brand-text { line-height: 1.25; min-width: 0; }
        .sidebar-brand .brand-text strong { display: block; font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 800; }
        .sidebar-brand .brand-text span { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

        .sidebar-section-label {
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            padding: 0.4rem 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .sidebar .nav-link {
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin: 0.18rem 1rem;
            padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            position: relative;
        }
        .sidebar .nav-link .nav-ico {
            width: 34px; height: 34px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            background: var(--glass-hover);
            font-size: 1rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }
        .sidebar .nav-link .nav-badge {
            margin-right: auto;
            background: var(--glass-hover);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 50rem;
        }
        .sidebar .nav-link:hover {
            background-color: var(--glass-hover);
            color: var(--text-main);
            transform: translateX(-4px);
        }
        .sidebar .nav-link.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light), var(--accent-color));
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(87,45,119,0.30);
        }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .sidebar .nav-link.active { color: #FFFFFF; }
        .sidebar .nav-link.active .nav-ico { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
        .sidebar .nav-link.active .nav-badge { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: #FFFFFF; }

        .sidebar-footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1.4rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        }
        .sidebar-clock {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: var(--glass-hover);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }
        .sidebar-footer .logout-link {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--danger-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.55rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }
        .sidebar-footer .logout-link:hover { background: rgba(214,69,59,0.12); }

        .main-content { flex: 1; margin-right: var(--sidebar-width); min-width: 0; transition: margin 0.3s ease; }
        .content-wrapper { padding: 1.5rem; padding-top: calc(var(--topbar-height) + 1.5rem); max-width: 1400px; }

        .topbar {
            height: var(--topbar-height);
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; right: var(--sidebar-width); left: 0;
            z-index: 1040;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px var(--glass-shadow);
            transition: right 0.3s ease;
        }
        .topbar-title { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.02rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; }
        .topbar-title .topbar-sub { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; display: block; }
        .sidebar-toggle-btn { display: none; }

        .sidebar-overlay {
            display: none;
            position: fixed; inset: 0;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            z-index: 1045;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        @media (max-width: 991.98px) {
            .sidebar { transform: translateX(100%); }
            .sidebar.show { transform: translateX(0); }
            .main-content { margin-right: 0; }
            .topbar { right: 0; padding: 0 1rem; }
            .sidebar-overlay.show { display: block; opacity: 1; }
            .sidebar-toggle-btn { display: flex; }
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(160%);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(160%);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px var(--glass-shadow);
            padding: 1.6rem;
            transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease-bubble), background 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease;
        }
        .glass-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 14px 38px var(--glass-shadow); }

        .glass-input, .glass-select, .glass-textarea {
            background: var(--input-bg) !important;
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border) !important;
            color: var(--text-main) !important;
            border-radius: 18px !important;
            box-shadow: none !important;
            transition: box-shadow 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease, transform 0.2s var(--ease-bubble) !important;
        }
        .glass-input:focus, .glass-select:focus, .glass-textarea:focus {
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(87,45,119, 0.18) !important;
            border-color: var(--accent-color) !important;
            background: var(--input-focus) !important;
            transform: translateY(-1px) !important;
        }
        option { background-color: var(--option-bg); color: var(--text-main); }

        .table { color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 0; }
        .table th, .table td {
            background-color: transparent !important;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border) !important;
            vertical-align: middle;
            padding: 1.1rem 1rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }
        .table thead th {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--glass-border) !important;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
        }
        .table-hover tbody tr { transition: background-color 0.25s ease; }
        .table-hover tbody tr:hover { background-color: var(--glass-hover) !important; }

        .theme-butn {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--accent-color);
            width: 44px; height: 44px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        .theme-butn:hover { transform: rotate(18deg) scale(1.08); background: var(--btn-hover); }

        .btn-accent {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light), var(--accent-color));
            color: #FFFFFF !important;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(87,45,119, 0.28);
            transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-bubble), box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn-accent:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.015); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(87,45,119, 0.4); }
        .btn-accent:active { transform: translateY(-1px) scale(0.97); }
        .btn-accent:disabled { opacity: 0.6; transform: none; }

        .btn-glass {
            background: var(--btn-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--text-main);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-bubble), background 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease;
        }
        .btn-glass:hover { background: var(--btn-hover); color: var(--text-main); transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .btn-glass:active { transform: translateY(0) scale(0.97); }

        .text-accent { color: var(--accent-color) !important; }
        .text-muted-custom { color: var(--text-muted) !important; opacity: 0.9; }
        .border-glass { border-color: var(--glass-border) !important; }

        .content-section { display: none; }
        .content-section.active-section { display: block; animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-in-out; }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        .password-toggle {
            position: absolute; left: 14px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
            cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-muted); background: none; border: none; padding: 0; z-index: 5;
        }
        .input-password-wrap { position: relative; }
        .input-password-wrap .glass-input { padding-left: 44px; }

        input::placeholder, textarea::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted) !important; opacity: 0.8; }

        .stat-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(160%);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px var(--glass-shadow);
            padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            height: 100%;
            transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease-bubble), box-shadow 0.35s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .stat-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 14px 34px var(--glass-shadow); }
        .stat-card .stat-icon {
            width: 54px; height: 54px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #fff;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
            transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-bubble);
        }
        .stat-card:hover .stat-icon { transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-6deg); }
        .stat-card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        .stat-trend { font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 50rem; }

        .cat-bar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; }
        .cat-bar-dot { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-size: 0.95rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); overflow: hidden; }
        .cat-bar-track { flex: 1; height: 9px; border-radius: 50rem; background: var(--glass-hover); overflow: hidden; margin-top: 4px; position: relative; }
        .cat-bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 50rem; transition: width 0.8s var(--ease-bubble); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .cat-bar-fill::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.4), transparent);
            transform: translateX(-100%);
            animation: barShimmer 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes barShimmer { 0% { transform: translateX(-100%); } 60%, 100% { transform: translateX(100%); } }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .cat-bar-fill::after { animation: none; } }

        .icon-swatch-0 { background: var(--sw-0); } .icon-swatch-1 { background: var(--sw-1); }
        .icon-swatch-2 { background: var(--sw-2); } .icon-swatch-3 { background: var(--sw-3); }
        .icon-swatch-4 { background: var(--sw-4); } .icon-swatch-5 { background: var(--sw-5); }
        .icon-swatch-6 { background: var(--sw-6); } .icon-swatch-7 { background: var(--sw-7); }
        .icon-swatch-8 { background: var(--sw-8); } .icon-swatch-9 { background: var(--sw-9); }

        .icon-picker-preview {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
            padding: 0.9rem 1rem; border-radius: 18px;
            background: var(--glass-hover); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
        }
        .icon-picker-preview .ipv-box {
            width: 54px; height: 54px; border-radius: 18px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.55rem; color: var(--accent-color);
            background: var(--glass-bg); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
            flex-shrink: 0; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px;
        }
        .icon-picker-preview .ipv-box img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }

        .visual-picker-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
            gap: 10px; max-height: 320px; overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 10px; border-radius: 18px;
            background: var(--input-bg); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        }
        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .visual-picker-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); }
        }
        .visual-picker-grid::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
        .visual-picker-grid::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--glass-border); border-radius: 5px; }
        .visual-picker-item {
            aspect-ratio: 1/1; border-radius: 16px; cursor: pointer;
            background: var(--glass-bg); border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 8px; position: relative; transition: transform .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
        }
        .visual-picker-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
        .visual-picker-item:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.06); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.18); border-color: var(--accent-light); }
        .visual-picker-item.active { border-color: var(--accent-color); background: var(--brand-soft); }
        .visual-picker-item.active::after {
            content: '\F26E'; font-family: 'bootstrap-icons'; position: absolute; bottom: -4px; left: -4px;
            background: var(--success-color); color: #fff; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%;
            font-size: 0.55rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .cat-img-upload {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
            padding: .9rem; border-radius: 18px;
            background: var(--input-bg); border: 1px dashed var(--glass-border);
            transition: all .25s ease; cursor: pointer;
        }
        .cat-img-upload:hover, .cat-img-upload.dragover {
            border-color: var(--accent-color); background: var(--brand-soft);
        }
        .cat-img-upload-icon {
            width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 16px; flex-shrink: 0;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            background: var(--glass-bg); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--accent-color);
        }
        .cat-img-upload .txt strong { display: block; font-size: .85rem; }
        .cat-img-upload .txt span { font-size: .74rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .cat-img-remove {
            border: none; background: rgba(214,69,59,0.12); color: #D6453B;
            border-radius: 14px; width: 32px; height: 32px; flex-shrink: 0;
            display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        .cat-img-remove.show { display: flex; }

        .cat-icon-badge {
            width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 14px;
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            overflow: hidden; padding: 5px;
        }
        .cat-icon-badge img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
        .product-cat-pill {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
            background: var(--glass-hover); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 50rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem 0.3rem 0.9rem; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
        }
        .product-cat-pill .dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

        .img-thumb-ph {
            width: 55px; height: 55px; border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            background: var(--glass-hover); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .product-mobile-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.8rem; }
        .product-mobile-card {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.9rem;
            background: var(--glass-hover); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 22px; padding: 0.8rem;
            transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-bubble), box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        .product-mobile-card:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
        .pmc-img {
            width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; flex-shrink: 0;
            background: var(--input-bg);
        }
        .pmc-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
        .pmc-img .img-thumb-ph { width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 0; border: none; }
        .pmc-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem; }
        .pmc-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-main); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
        .pmc-price { font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--accent-color); }
        .pmc-price small { font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.68rem; }
        .pmc-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .pmc-actions .btn { width: 38px; height: 38px; padding: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 16px; }

        .upload-drop {
            border: 1.5px dashed var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: var(--input-bg);
            padding: 1.4rem;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }
        .upload-drop:hover, .upload-drop.dragover { border-color: var(--accent-color); background: var(--glass-hover); }
        .upload-drop i { font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--accent-color); }

        .char-counter { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: left; margin-top: 0.3rem; }

        .product-form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.55fr 1fr; gap: 1.6rem; align-items: start; }
        @media (max-width: 991.98px) { .product-form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

        .form-block {
            background: var(--glass-hover);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 1.25rem 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        .form-block:focus-within { border-color: var(--accent-color); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(87,45,119,0.12); }
        .form-block-title {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .form-block-title i { color: var(--accent-color); font-size: 1rem; }

        .product-form-preview { position: sticky; top: 1rem; }
        .live-menu-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 28px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px var(--glass-shadow);
            transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-bubble);
        }
        .live-menu-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .live-menu-card-img {
            position: relative; display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/11;
            background: var(--input-bg); cursor: pointer; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .live-menu-card-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
        .upload-drop-hint {
            position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 1rem;
            border: 1.5px dashed var(--glass-border); border-radius: inherit; margin: 8px;
            transition: border-color 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease;
        }
        .upload-drop-hint i { font-size: 1.9rem; color: var(--accent-color); }
        .live-menu-card-img:hover .upload-drop-hint, .live-menu-card-img.dragover .upload-drop-hint {
            border-color: var(--accent-color); background: var(--glass-hover);
        }
        #addPreviewContainer:not(.d-none) ~ .upload-drop-hint,
        .live-menu-card-img:has(#addPreviewContainer:not(.d-none)) .upload-drop-hint { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }

        .live-menu-card-body { padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.3rem; }
        .live-menu-card-cat {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem;
            font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-color);
            background: rgba(87,45,119,0.14); border-radius: 50rem; padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .live-menu-card-name { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.02rem; margin: 0 0 0.3rem; color: var(--text-main); }
        .live-menu-card-desc {
            font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
            display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .live-menu-card-price { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--accent-color); }
        .live-menu-card-price small { font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; }

        .empty-state { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .empty-state i { font-size: 2.6rem; color: var(--accent-color); opacity: 0.6; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; display: block; }

        .badge-soft-success { background: rgba(46,138,80,0.15); color: var(--success-color); }
        .badge-soft-danger { background: rgba(214,69,59,0.15); color: var(--danger-color); }

        .cat-type-toggle {
            display: inline-flex; gap: 0.4rem; padding: 0.3rem;
            background: var(--glass-hover); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 50rem; width: 100%;
        }
        .cat-type-btn {
            flex: 1 1 0; border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.82rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 50rem;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.4rem;
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }
        .cat-type-btn.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light), var(--accent-color));
            color: #FFFFFF; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(87,45,119,0.28);
        }
        [data-bs-theme="dark"] .cat-type-btn.active { color: #FFFFFF; }

        .cat-parent-wrap {
            overflow: hidden;
            max-height: 0; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px);
            transition: max-height 0.4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease, margin 0.3s ease;
        }
        .cat-parent-wrap.show { max-height: 160px; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        .cat-sub-wrap {
            overflow: hidden;
            max-height: 0; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px);
            transition: max-height 0.4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .cat-sub-wrap.show { max-height: 130px; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        .cat-tree-render { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .cat-pill-main, .cat-pill-sub {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem;
            border-radius: 50rem; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .cat-pill-main {
            padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem; font-size: 0.78rem;
            background: var(--glass-hover); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); color: var(--text-main);
        }
        .cat-pill-sub {
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; font-size: 0.72rem;
            background: rgba(87,45,119,0.14); border: 1px solid rgba(87,45,119,0.28); color: var(--accent-color);
        }
        .cat-tree-render i.cat-tree-sep { font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

        .product-cat-pill { flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .product-cat-pill .cat-pill-sub { padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.7rem; }

        .cat-card-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(210px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        .cat-manage-card {
            background: var(--glass-hover);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 1.1rem;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.55rem;
            transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease-bubble), box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .cat-manage-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 10px 26px var(--glass-shadow); border-color: var(--accent-color); }
        .cmc-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
        .cmc-count {
            font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted);
            background: var(--input-bg); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 50rem; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
        }
        .cmc-name { font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-main); }
        .cmc-enname { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: -0.4rem; }
        .cmc-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.4rem; }
        .cmc-actions .btn-sm { border-radius: 16px; }

        @media (max-width: 575.98px) {
            .content-wrapper { padding: 1rem; padding-top: calc(var(--topbar-height) + 1rem); }
            .glass-card { padding: 1.1rem; border-radius: 18px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="admin-layout">

    <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-brand">
            <div class="brand-mark"><img width="100%" height="100%" src="/images/logo/Nan.O.Nan-white.png" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain;" alt="بنان و نان"></div>
            <div class="brand-text">
                <strong>بنان و نان</strong>
                <span>بنان و نان | پنل مدیریت</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <nav class="py-2" id="sidebarNav">
            <div class="sidebar-section-label">نمای کلی</div>
            <a class="nav-link active" href="#dashboard" onclick="setActiveTab('dashboard'); closeSidebarOnMobile();">
                <span class="nav-ico"><i class="bi bi-speedometer2"></i></span> داشبورد
            </a>

            <div class="sidebar-section-label">مدیریت منو</div>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#addProduct" onclick="setActiveTab('addProduct'); closeSidebarOnMobile();">
                <span class="nav-ico"><i class="bi bi-plus-circle-fill"></i></span> افزودن محصول
            </a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#productList" onclick="setActiveTab('productList'); closeSidebarOnMobile();">
                <span class="nav-ico"><i class="bi bi-list-stars"></i></span> لیست محصولات
                <span class="nav-badge"><%= typeof iteam !== 'undefined' ? iteam.length : 0 %></span>
            </a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#categoryManage" onclick="setActiveTab('categoryManage'); closeSidebarOnMobile();">
                <span class="nav-ico"><i class="bi bi-grid-fill"></i></span> دسته‌بندی‌ها
                <span class="nav-badge"><%= typeof categories !== 'undefined' ? categories.length : 0 %></span>
            </a>

            <div class="sidebar-section-label">حساب کاربری</div>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#changeCredentials" onclick="setActiveTab('changeCredentials'); closeSidebarOnMobile();">
                <span class="nav-ico"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill"></i></span> امنیت و رمز عبور
            </a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="/" target="_blank">
                <span class="nav-ico"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-left"></i></span> مشاهده سایت
            </a>
        </nav>

        <div class="sidebar-footer">
            <div class="sidebar-clock">
                <span class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><i class="bi bi-clock-fill text-accent"></i> <span id="liveClock">--:--</span></span>
                <span id="liveDate">----</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/logout" class="logout-link">
                <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right"></i> خروج از پنل
            </a>
        </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="sidebar-overlay" id="sidebarOverlay" onclick="toggleSidebar()"></div>

    <main class="main-content">

        <header class="topbar">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                <button class="theme-butn sidebar-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleSidebar()" aria-label="منو">
                    <i class="bi bi-list"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="topbar-title">
                   <img width="75px" height="75px" src="/images/logo/Nan.O.Nan-brand.png" style="width: 75px; height: 75px; object-fit: contain;" alt="بنان و نان">
                    <div>
                        پنل مدیریت بنان و نان
                        <span class="topbar-sub">خوش اومدی، امروز روز خوبی برای یه لیوان بابل تیله خنکه 🧋✨</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <a href="/" target="_blank" class="btn-glass d-none d-md-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2 text-decoration-none" style="font-size:0.82rem;">
                    <i class="bi bi-eye-fill"></i> مشاهده منو
                </a>
                <button class="theme-butn" id="themeBtn" onclick="toggleTheme()" aria-label="تغییر تم">
                    <i class="bi bi-sun-fill" id="themeIcon"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="content-wrapper">

            <%
                // ---------- کمک‌تابع‌های محاسباتی (بدون نیاز به فیلد جدید در دیتابیس) ----------
                function swatchIndex(str){
                    if(!str) return 0;
                    var h = 0;
                    for (var i=0;i<str.length;i++){ h = (h + str.charCodeAt(i)) % 10; }
                    return h;
                }
                function fmtNum(n){
                    if(n === undefined || n === null || n === '') return '0';
                    return String(n).replace(/\B(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))/g, ',');
                }
                var allProducts = typeof iteam !== 'undefined' ? iteam : [];
                var allCategories = typeof categories !== 'undefined' ? categories : [];
                var totalValue = 0, missingImg = 0;
                allProducts.forEach(function(p){
                    totalValue += Number(p.iteamPrice) || 0;
                    if (!p.imageUrl) missingImg++;
                });
                var avgPrice = allProducts.length ? Math.round(totalValue / allProducts.length) : 0;
                var catCounts = {};
                allProducts.forEach(function(p){ catCounts[p.category] = (catCounts[p.category] || 0) + 1; });
                function catByName(n){ return allCategories.find(function(c){ return c.name === n; }); }

                var topCategoryName = null, topCategoryCount = 0;
                allCategories.forEach(function(c){
                    var cnt = catCounts[c.name] || 0;
                    if (cnt > topCategoryCount) { topCategoryCount = cnt; topCategoryName = c.name; }
                });
                var CAT_SEP_DASH = ' — ';
                var parentGroupSet = {};
                allCategories.forEach(function(c){
                    var idx = String(c.name).indexOf(CAT_SEP_DASH);
                    if (idx !== -1) parentGroupSet[c.name.slice(0, idx).trim()] = true;
                });
                var groupsWithSubCount = Object.keys(parentGroupSet).length;
            %>

            <section id="dashboardSection" class="content-section active-section">
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-4 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="bi bi-pie-chart-fill text-accent"></i>
                    آمار و وضعیت کلی بنان و نان
                </h5>

                <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 row-cols-xl-5 g-3 mb-4">
                    <div class="col">
                        <div class="stat-card">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-muted-custom d-block mb-1 fw-medium" style="font-size:0.78rem;">کل محصولات</span>
                                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0"><%= allProducts.length %></h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat-icon icon-swatch-0"><i class="bi bi-box-seam-fill"></i></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <div class="stat-card">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-muted-custom d-block mb-1 fw-medium" style="font-size:0.78rem;">دسته‌بندی‌ها</span>
                                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0"><%= allCategories.length %></h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat-icon icon-swatch-5"><i class="bi bi-tags-fill"></i></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <div class="stat-card">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-muted-custom d-block mb-1 fw-medium" style="font-size:0.78rem;">ارزش کل منو</span>
                                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0" style="font-size:1.15rem;"><%= fmtNum(totalValue) %> <small class="fw-normal text-muted-custom" style="font-size:0.7rem;">تومان</small></h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat-icon icon-swatch-3"><i class="bi bi-cash-coin"></i></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <div class="stat-card">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-muted-custom d-block mb-1 fw-medium" style="font-size:0.78rem;">میانگین قیمت</span>
                                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0" style="font-size:1.15rem;"><%= fmtNum(avgPrice) %> <small class="fw-normal text-muted-custom" style="font-size:0.7rem;">تومان</small></h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat-icon icon-swatch-6"><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <div class="stat-card">
                            <div class="flex-grow-1" style="min-width:0;">
                                <span class="text-muted-custom d-block mb-1 fw-medium" style="font-size:0.78rem;">محبوب‌ترین دسته</span>
                                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-truncate" style="font-size:1.05rem;"><%= topCategoryName || '—' %></h3>
                                <span class="text-muted-custom" style="font-size:0.7rem;"><%= topCategoryCount %> محصول</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat-icon icon-swatch-1"><i class="bi bi-trophy-fill"></i></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
                    <div class="col-12">
                        <div class="glass-card">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill text-accent"></i> دسترسی سریع
                            </h6>
                            <div class="row g-2">
                                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                                    <a href="#addProduct" onclick="setActiveTab('addProduct')" class="btn btn-glass w-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2 py-3 text-decoration-none">
                                        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle-fill fs-5 text-accent"></i>
                                        <span style="font-size:0.8rem;">محصول جدید</span>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                                    <a href="#categoryManage" onclick="setActiveTab('categoryManage')" class="btn btn-glass w-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2 py-3 text-decoration-none">
                                        <i class="bi bi-grid-fill fs-5 text-accent"></i>
                                        <span style="font-size:0.8rem;">دسته‌بندی جدید</span>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                                    <a href="/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-glass w-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2 py-3 text-decoration-none">
                                        <i class="bi bi-eye-fill fs-5 text-accent"></i>
                                        <span style="font-size:0.8rem;">مشاهده منو</span>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                                    <a href="#changeCredentials" onclick="setActiveTab('changeCredentials')" class="btn btn-glass w-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2 py-3 text-decoration-none">
                                        <i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill fs-5 text-accent"></i>
                                        <span style="font-size:0.8rem;">تنظیمات امنیتی</span>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-4">
                    <div class="col-md-7">
                        <div class="glass-card h-100">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-4 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="bi bi-bar-chart-fill text-accent"></i> توزیع محصولات بر اساس دسته‌بندی
                            </h6>
                            <% if (allCategories.length > 0) { %>
                                <% allCategories.forEach(function(cat){
                                    var cnt = catCounts[cat.name] || 0;
                                    var pct = allProducts.length ? Math.round((cnt / allProducts.length) * 100) : 0;
                                    var sIdx = swatchIndex(cat.icon || cat.name);
                                %>
                                <div class="cat-bar-row">
                                    <div class="cat-bar-dot icon-swatch-<%= sIdx %>">
                                        <% if (cat.image) { %>
                                            <img src="<%= cat.image %>" alt="" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; border-radius:inherit;">
                                        <% } else { %>
                                            <i class="bi <%= cat.icon || 'bi-grid' %>"></i>
                                        <% } %>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="flex-grow-1">
                                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-1">
                                            <span class="fw-semibold" style="font-size:0.85rem;"><%= cat.name %></span>
                                            <span class="text-muted-custom" style="font-size:0.78rem;"><%= cnt %> محصول · <%= pct %>%</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="cat-bar-track">
                                            <div class="cat-bar-fill icon-swatch-<%= sIdx %>" style="width: <%= pct %>%;"></div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <% }) %>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <div class="empty-state py-3">
                                    <i class="bi bi-tags"></i>
                                    <p class="mb-0">هنوز دسته‌بندی‌ای ثبت نشده است.</p>
                                </div>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-5">
                        <div class="glass-card h-100">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-4 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="bi bi-clipboard-check-fill text-accent"></i> سلامت سیستم و منو
                            </h6>
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-3 rounded-3 mb-3" style="background: var(--glass-hover); border:1px solid var(--glass-border);">
                                <span class="fw-semibold d-flex align-items-center gap-2" style="font-size:0.88rem;">
                                    <span class="spinner-grow spinner-grow-sm text-success"></span> سرور و پنل
                                </span>
                                <span class="badge-soft-success rounded-pill px-3 py-2 fw-bold" style="font-size:0.72rem;">فعال و آنلاین</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-3 rounded-3 mb-3" style="background: var(--glass-hover); border:1px solid var(--glass-border);">
                                <span class="fw-semibold" style="font-size:0.88rem;">محصولات بدون تصویر</span>
                                <span class="<%= missingImg > 0 ? 'badge-soft-danger' : 'badge-soft-success' %> rounded-pill px-3 py-2 fw-bold" style="font-size:0.72rem;"><%= missingImg %> مورد</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-3 rounded-3 mb-3" style="background: var(--glass-hover); border:1px solid var(--glass-border);">
                                <span class="fw-semibold" style="font-size:0.88rem;">دسته‌بندی‌های خالی</span>
                                <% var emptyCats = allCategories.filter(function(c){ return !(catCounts[c.name] > 0); }).length; %>
                                <span class="<%= emptyCats > 0 ? 'badge-soft-danger' : 'badge-soft-success' %> rounded-pill px-3 py-2 fw-bold" style="font-size:0.72rem;"><%= emptyCats %> مورد</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-3 rounded-3" style="background: var(--glass-hover); border:1px solid var(--glass-border);">
                                <span class="fw-semibold" style="font-size:0.88rem;">دسته‌های دارای زیرمجموعه</span>
                                <span class="badge-soft-success rounded-pill px-3 py-2 fw-bold" style="font-size:0.72rem;"><%= groupsWithSubCount %> گروه</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="addProductSection" class="content-section">
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle-fill text-accent"></i>
                        افزودن محصول جدید به منو
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-muted-custom mb-4" style="font-size:0.82rem;">اطلاعات محصول را کامل کن؛ در سمت راست دقیقاً همان‌طور که در منو دیده می‌شود پیش‌نمایش می‌گیری 🧋</p>

                    <form action="/admin" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="product-form-grid" id="addProductForm">

                        <div class="product-form-fields">
                            <div class="form-block">
                                <div class="form-block-title"><i class="bi bi-tag-fill"></i> اطلاعات پایه</div>
                                <div class="row g-3">
                                    <div class="col-md-7">
                                        <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">نام محصول</label>
                                        <input type="text" name="iteamName" id="addNameField" class="form-control glass-input" required placeholder="مثال: بابل تی موز">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-5">
                                        <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">قیمت (تومان)</label>
                                        <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" name="iteamPrice" id="addPriceField" class="form-control glass-input price-input" required placeholder="مثال: 185,000">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="form-block">
                                <div class="form-block-title"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill"></i> دسته‌بندی</div>
                                <div class="row g-3">
                                    <div class="col-md-6">
                                        <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">دسته اصلی</label>
                                        <select class="form-select glass-select cat-cascade-main" id="addMainCategorySelect" required <%= allCategories.length === 0 ? 'disabled' : '' %>>
                                            <% if (allCategories.length === 0) { %>
                                                <option value="">ابتدا دسته‌بندی بسازید</option>
                                            <% } %>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-6 cat-sub-wrap" id="addSubWrap">
                                        <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">زیردسته</label>
                                        <select class="form-select glass-select cat-cascade-sub" id="addSubCategorySelect"></select>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <select name="category" id="addRealCategorySelect" class="visually-hidden" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <% allCategories.forEach(function(cat){ %>
                                        <option value="<%= cat.name %>"><%= cat.name %></option>
                                    <% }) %>
                                </select>
                            </div>

                            <div class="form-block">
                                <div class="form-block-title"><i class="bi bi-card-text"></i> توضیحات و ترکیبات</div>
                                <textarea name="description" class="form-control glass-textarea" rows="4" maxlength="400" id="addDescField"
                                          placeholder="ترکیبات: چای، شیر، مروارید تاپیوکا، شربت موز..."></textarea>
                                <div class="char-counter"><span id="addDescCount">0</span>/400</div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2 mt-1">
                                <button type="reset" class="btn btn-glass px-4">پاک کردن فرم</button>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-accent px-5">
                                    <i class="bi bi-check-circle me-1"></i> ثبت و انتشار محصول
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="product-form-preview">
                            <div class="form-block-title"><i class="bi bi-eye-fill"></i> پیش‌نمایش زنده</div>
                            <div class="live-menu-card">
                                <label class="live-menu-card-img upload-drop-overlay" id="addUploadDrop">
                                    <div class="upload-drop-hint" id="addUploadHint">
                                        <i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-up-fill d-block mb-2"></i>
                                        <span class="fw-semibold d-block" style="font-size:0.82rem;" id="addUploadLabel">برای انتخاب تصویر کلیک کن</span>
                                        <span class="text-muted-custom" style="font-size:0.68rem;">PNG, JPG یا WEBP</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="addPreviewContainer" class="d-none">
                                        <img id="addPreview" alt="پیش‌نمایش محصول">
                                    </div>
                                    <input type="file" name="imageUrl" id="addImageInput" accept="image/*" class="d-none" onchange="previewAddImage(event)">
                                </label>
                                <div class="live-menu-card-body">
                                    <span class="live-menu-card-cat" id="livePreviewCat"><i class="bi bi-tag"></i> دسته‌بندی</span>
                                    <h6 class="live-menu-card-name" id="livePreviewName">نام محصول شما</h6>
                                    <p class="live-menu-card-desc" id="livePreviewDesc">توضیحات محصول اینجا نمایش داده می‌شود...</p>
                                    <div class="live-menu-card-price" id="livePreviewPrice">۰ <small>تومان</small></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </form>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="productListSection" class="content-section">
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-lg-row justify-content-between align-items-lg-center gap-3 mb-4">
                        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-0 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="bi bi-list-stars text-accent"></i>
                            مدیریت و لیست محصولات منو
                        </h5>
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
                            <select class="form-select glass-select" id="categoryFilter" style="max-width:180px;" onchange="filterByCategory(this.value)">
                                <option value="">همه دسته‌بندی‌ها</option>
                                <% allCategories.forEach(function(cat){ %>
                                    <option value="<%= cat.name %>"><%= cat.name %></option>
                                <% }) %>
                            </select>
                            <div style="max-width: 260px; width: 100%;">
                                <input type="text" class="form-control glass-input rounded-pill" placeholder="جستجو در نام محصولات..." id="productSearchInput" onkeyup="searchTable(this.value)">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
                        <span class="text-muted-custom" style="font-size:0.8rem;" id="productCountLabel">نمایش <%= allProducts.length %> از <%= allProducts.length %> محصول</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="table-responsive d-none d-md-block">
                        <table class="table table-hover align-middle" id="productTable">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="ps-4">تصویر</th>
                                    <th>نام محصول</th>
                                    <th>قیمت</th>
                                    <th>دسته‌بندی</th>
                                    <th class="text-center pe-4">عملیات</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <% if (allProducts.length > 0) { %>
                                    <% allProducts.forEach(function(it){
                                        var cat = catByName(it.category);
                                        var sIdx = swatchIndex(cat ? (cat.icon || cat.name) : it.category);
                                    %>
                                        <tr data-category="<%= it.category %>">
                                            <td class="ps-4">
                                                <% if (it.imageUrl) { %>
                                                    <img src="<%= it.imageUrl %>" width="55" height="55" class="rounded-3 object-fit-cover shadow-sm border-glass">
                                                <% } else { %>
                                                    <div class="img-thumb-ph"><i class="bi bi-image"></i></div>
                                                <% } %>
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="fw-semibold"><%= it.iteamName %></td>
                                            <td class="text-accent fw-bold"><%= fmtNum(it.iteamPrice) %> <small class="text-muted-custom fw-normal">تومان</small></td>
                                            <td>
                                                <span class="product-cat-pill">
                                                    <span class="dot icon-swatch-<%= sIdx %>"></span>
                                                    <span class="cat-name-render" data-cat-name="<%= it.category %>"><%= it.category %></span>
                                                </span>
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="text-center pe-4">
                                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-2">
                                                    <a href="/admin/edit/<%= it._id %>" class="btn btn-glass btn-sm text-accent">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-pencil-square"></i> ویرایش
                                                    </a>
                                                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-glass btn-sm text-danger" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#deleteModal"
                                                            data-bs-title="<%= it.iteamName %>" data-bs-id="<%= it._id %>">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-trash"></i> حذف
                                                    </button>
                                                </div>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    <% }) %>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td colspan="5">
                                            <div class="empty-state">
                                                <i class="bi bi-inboxes"></i>
                                                <p class="mb-0">هیچ محصولی در سیستم یافت نشد. از تب «افزودن محصول» شروع کنید.</p>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                <% } %>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-mobile-list d-md-none" id="productCards">
                        <% if (allProducts.length > 0) { %>
                            <% allProducts.forEach(function(it){
                                var cat = catByName(it.category);
                                var sIdx = swatchIndex(cat ? (cat.icon || cat.name) : it.category);
                            %>
                                <div class="product-mobile-card" data-category="<%= it.category %>">
                                    <div class="pmc-img">
                                        <% if (it.imageUrl) { %>
                                            <img src="<%= it.imageUrl %>" alt="<%= it.iteamName %>">
                                        <% } else { %>
                                            <div class="img-thumb-ph"><i class="bi bi-image"></i></div>
                                        <% } %>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="pmc-body">
                                        <div class="pmc-name"><%= it.iteamName %></div>
                                        <span class="product-cat-pill">
                                            <span class="dot icon-swatch-<%= sIdx %>"></span>
                                            <span class="cat-name-render" data-cat-name="<%= it.category %>"><%= it.category %></span>
                                        </span>
                                        <div class="pmc-price"><%= fmtNum(it.iteamPrice) %> <small>تومان</small></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="pmc-actions">
                                        <a href="/admin/edit/<%= it._id %>" class="btn btn-glass btn-sm text-accent">
                                            <i class="bi bi-pencil-square"></i>
                                        </a>
                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-glass btn-sm text-danger" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#deleteModal"
                                                data-bs-title="<%= it.iteamName %>" data-bs-id="<%= it._id %>">
                                            <i class="bi bi-trash"></i>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            <% }) %>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <div class="empty-state">
                                <i class="bi bi-inboxes"></i>
                                <p class="mb-0">هیچ محصولی در سیستم یافت نشد. از تب «افزودن محصول» شروع کنید.</p>
                            </div>
                        <% } %>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="categoryManageSection" class="content-section">
                <div class="glass-card mb-4">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-4 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="bi bi-plus-square-fill text-accent"></i>
                        ایجاد دسته‌بندی جدید
                    </h5>
                    <form action="/admin/category/add" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="row g-3" id="addCategoryForm">
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">نوع دسته‌بندی</label>
                            <div class="cat-type-toggle" id="addCatTypeToggle">
                                <button type="button" class="cat-type-btn active" data-type="main">
                                    <i class="bi bi-diagram-2-fill"></i> دسته اصلی
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="cat-type-btn" data-type="sub">
                                    <i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill"></i> زیرمجموعه یک دسته
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 cat-parent-wrap" id="addParentWrap">
                            <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">دسته والد</label>
                            <select class="form-select glass-select" id="addParentSelect">
                                <% allCategories.filter(function(c){ return String(c.name).indexOf(' — ') === -1; }).forEach(function(cat){ %>
                                    <option value="<%= cat.name %>"><%= cat.name %></option>
                                <% }) %>
                            </select>
                            <% if (allCategories.filter(function(c){ return String(c.name).indexOf(' — ') === -1; }).length === 0) { %>
                                <div class="form-text text-danger">ابتدا یک دسته اصلی بسازید تا بتوانید زیرمجموعه تعریف کنید.</div>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom" id="addCatNameLabel">نام فارسی</label>
                            <input type="text" name="name" id="addCategoryNameInput" class="form-control glass-input" required placeholder="مثال: نوشیدنی‌های سرد">
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">نام انگلیسی</label>
                            <input type="text" name="enname" class="form-control glass-input" required placeholder="مثال: cold-drinks">
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-12">
                            <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">تصویر دسته‌بندی</label>

                            <div class="icon-picker-preview">
                                <div class="ipv-box" id="addVisualPreviewBox">
                                    <i class="bi bi-image"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <span class="fw-semibold d-block" id="addVisualPreviewLabel">هیچ تصویری انتخاب نشده</span>
                                    <span class="text-muted-custom" style="font-size:0.78rem;">یکی از وکتورهای آماده را انتخاب یا تصویر دلخواه آپلود کنید</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <input type="text" id="addVisualPickerSearch" class="form-control glass-input mb-2"
                                   placeholder="جستجو در وکتورها... (مثال: چای، شیر، مروارید)">

                            <div class="visual-picker-grid" id="addVisualPickerGrid"></div>

                            <label class="cat-img-upload mt-3" id="addCategoryImageDrop" for="addCategoryImageInput">
                                <div class="cat-img-upload-icon"><i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-up"></i></div>
                                <div class="txt flex-grow-1">
                                    <strong>آپلود تصویر یا وکتور دلخواه</strong>
                                    <span>SVG / PNG / JPG — برای آپلود کلیک یا فایل را رها کنید</span>
                                </div>
                                <button type="button" class="cat-img-remove" id="addCategoryImageRemoveBtn" title="حذف تصویر">
                                    <i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i>
                                </button>
                                <input type="file" name="image" id="addCategoryImageInput" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/svg+xml,.svg,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.webp" class="visually-hidden">
                            </label>

                            <input type="hidden" name="imageUrl" id="addSelectedImageUrl" value="">
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-12 text-end mt-2">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-accent px-5">
                                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-1"></i> افزودن دسته‌بندی
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-4 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="bi bi-grid-fill text-accent"></i>
                        دسته‌بندی‌های موجود
                        <span class="badge rounded-pill ms-1" style="background: var(--glass-hover); color: var(--text-muted); border:1px solid var(--glass-border); font-size:0.7rem;"><%= allCategories.length %></span>
                    </h5>

                    <% if (allCategories.length > 0) { %>
                        <div class="cat-card-grid">
                            <% allCategories.forEach(function(cat, index){
                                var sIdx = swatchIndex(cat.icon || cat.name);
                                var cnt = catCounts[cat.name] || 0;
                            %>
                                <div class="cat-manage-card">
                                    <div class="cmc-top">
                                        <span class="cat-icon-badge icon-swatch-<%= sIdx %>">
                                            <% if (cat.image) { %>
                                                <img src="<%= cat.image %>" alt="<%= cat.name %>" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; border-radius:inherit;">
                                            <% } else { %>
                                                <i class="bi <%= cat.icon || 'bi-image' %>"></i>
                                            <% } %>
                                        </span>
                                        <span class="cmc-count" title="تعداد محصولات این دسته"><%= cnt %> محصول</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="cmc-name cat-name-render" data-cat-name="<%= cat.name %>"><%= cat.name %></div>
                                    <div class="cmc-enname"><%= cat.enname %></div>
                                    <div class="cmc-actions">
                                        <a href="/admin/category/edit/<%= cat._id %>" class="btn btn-glass btn-sm text-accent flex-grow-1">
                                            <i class="bi bi-pencil-square"></i> ویرایش
                                        </a>
                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-glass btn-sm text-danger" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#deleteCategoryModal"
                                                data-bs-title="<%= cat.name %>" data-bs-id="<%= cat._id %>">
                                            <i class="bi bi-trash"></i>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            <% }) %>
                        </div>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <div class="empty-state">
                            <i class="bi bi-tags"></i>
                            <p class="mb-0">هیچ دسته‌بندی ثبت نشده است.</p>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="changeCredentialsSection" class="content-section">
                <div class="glass-card mx-auto" style="max-width: 550px;">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-4 text-center d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill text-accent"></i>
                        تنظیمات امنیتی و تغییر رمز عبور ادمین
                    </h5>
                    <form action="/admin/change-credentials" method="POST" id="credentialsForm" class="row g-3">
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">نام کاربری جدید</label>
                            <input type="text" name="username" class="form-control glass-input" required placeholder="نام کاربری جدید را وارد کنید">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">رمز عبور جدید</label>
                            <div class="input-password-wrap">
                                <input type="password" name="password" id="newPasswordInput" class="form-control glass-input" placeholder="رمز عبور قوی انتخاب کنید" autocomplete="new-password" required>
                                <button type="button" class="password-toggle" onclick="togglePassword('newPasswordInput', 'eyeIcon1')">
                                    <i class="bi bi-eye" id="eyeIcon1"></i>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <label class="form-label fw-medium text-muted-custom">تکرار رمز عبور جدید</label>
                            <div class="input-password-wrap">
                                <input type="password" name="confirmPassword" id="confirmPasswordInput" class="form-control glass-input" placeholder="رمز عبور جدید را مجدداً وارد کنید" autocomplete="new-password" required>
                                <button type="button" class="password-toggle" onclick="togglePassword('confirmPasswordInput', 'eyeIcon2')">
                                    <i class="bi bi-eye" id="eyeIcon2"></i>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-danger d-none mt-2" id="passwordMatchError" style="font-size:0.8rem;">
                                <i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle"></i> رمزهای عبور با یکدیگر مطابقت ندارند.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 text-end mt-3">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-accent w-100 py-3">
                                <i class="bi bi-check-circle me-1"></i> به‌روزرسانی اطلاعات امنیتی
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>
    </main>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="deleteModal" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
        <div class="modal-content glass-panel" style="border-radius: 24px;">
            <div class="modal-body text-center p-5">
                <div class="mb-3"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill text-danger" style="font-size: 2.8rem;"></i></div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-2">حذف محصول</h5>
                <p class="text-muted-custom mb-0">آیا از حذف محصول «<strong id="modalProductName"></strong>» اطمینان دارید؟ این عملیات غیرقابل بازگشت است.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer border-0 justify-content-center pt-0 pb-4 gap-2">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-glass rounded-pill px-4" data-bs-dismiss="modal">انصراف</button>
                <a href="#" id="confirmDeleteBtn" class="btn rounded-pill px-4 shadow" style="background: var(--danger-color); color: white; border: none;">بله، حذف شود</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="deleteCategoryModal" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
